 ( { b) While } 1. Qe7 { can be met by } Qd4 ) 
Kh7 2. Qe7+ Kh6 ( { After } 2... Kg8 3. g4 hxg4 4. hxg4 { preparing Kg5, White should also win. } ) 
3. g4 $1 hxg4 4. hxg4 g5+ { The ensuing pawn ending is lost, but Black had no other way to parry the mating threat. } 5. fxg5+ Kg6 6. Qf6+ $1 Qxf6 7. gxf6 Kxf6 8. Kh5 Kg7 9. Kg5 { White soon won. } 
